 'linear' to 'stronger-function-class', or a clean null settles the function
 class. (2) ARC north star: the new reproducible_total_levels (>=33?) across
 exp4372 (deeper high-headroom) + exp4373 (ar25/ka59/ft09 L2); how many NEW
